==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|goh|de}} {{m|goh|wuosti||waste}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{m|gem-pro|*wōstijaz||desolate, waste}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|de}} {{m|ine-pro|*wāsto-||empty, wasted}}. Compare English {{m|en|waste}}.

